(   2. Traction Inverter & Motor Control System:) Tj
T*
(   - Silicon Carbide \(SiC\) Power Switches: Converts 400V/800V DC battery power into) Tj
T*
(   variable-frequency, variable-amplitude 3-phase AC power to drive Permanent Magnet Synchronous) Tj
T*
(   Motors \(PMSM\).) Tj
T*
(   - Field-Oriented Control \(FOC\): High-speed DSPs execute Park and Clarke mathematical) Tj
T*
(   transformations at 20 kHz PWM switching frequencies, decoupling stator currents into magnetic) Tj
T*
(   flux and torque vectors to deliver smooth, instantaneous vehicular acceleration.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. In-Vehicle Networking \(IVN\) & Functional Safety:) Tj
T*
(   - Multi-Tier Bus Topology: High-speed Automotive Ethernet \(1000BASE-T1\) forms the) Tj
T*
(   high-bandwidth backbone interconnecting autonomous ADAS domain controllers. CAN-FD \(up to 5) Tj
T*
(   Mbps\) controls powertrain and chassis ECUs, while LIN handles low-cost body electronics \(seat) Tj
T*
(   adjustments, wipers, mirrors\).) Tj
T*
(   - ISO 26262 ASIL-D Compliance: Because powertrain and braking failures are safety-critical,) Tj
T*
(   microcontrollers \(e.g., Infineon AURIX, TI Hercules\) utilize lockstep dual-core CPUs running) Tj
T*
(   identical instructions with cycle-by-cycle hardware comparators, built-in memory ECC, and) Tj
T*
(   independent watchdog timers to guarantee safe fallback states upon hardware faults.) Tj
T*
