T*
(   1. The Scope of Embedded Systems Engineering:) Tj
T*
(   - Embedded systems represent specialized compute engines embedded within physical) Tj
T*
(   machinery?ranging from pacemakers and aircraft avionics to smart appliances and industrial) Tj
T*
(   robotics. Unlike general-purpose PCs, embedded devices must operate with strict real-time) Tj
T*
(   determinism, ultra-low power consumption, and minimal memory footprints.) Tj
