(   3. Signal Integrity \(SI\) & Eye Diagram Analytics:) Tj
T*
(   - Eye Diagrams: Overlaying thousands of consecutive bit transitions on an oscilloscope screen) Tj
T*
(   generates an eye diagram. Key metrics include Eye Height \(noise margin\) and Eye Width \(timing) Tj
T*
(   margin\).) Tj
T*
(   - Jitter Decomposition: Total Jitter \(TJ\) is mathematically partitioned into Deterministic) Tj
T*
(   Jitter \(DJ - bounded, caused by inter-symbol interference and crosstalk\) and Random Jitter \(RJ) Tj
T*
(   - unbounded Gaussian, caused by thermal and flicker noise\): TJ = DJ + 14 * sigma_RJ \(for Bit) Tj
T*
(   Error Rate = 10^-12\).) Tj
T*
(   - Equalization Techniques: Continuous-Time Linear Equalization \(CTLE\) and Decision Feedback) Tj
T*
(   Equalization \(DFE\) circuits are integrated into receiver SerDes chips to open closed eye) Tj
T*
(   diagrams caused by high-frequency dielectric attenuation in PCB traces.) Tj
