T*
(   mechanical shaft misalignment months before catastrophic mechanical failure.) Tj
T*
(   - Sensor Telemetry Protocols: Sensor nodes communicate using robust industrial protocols such) Tj
T*
(   as Modbus-RTU, PROFINET, IO-Link, and publish telemetry over MQTT / OPC-UA to plant-wide) Tj
T*
(   supervisory control and data acquisition \(SCADA\) systems.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Industrial Wireless Mesh & Low-Power Wide-Area Networks \(LPWAN\):) Tj
T*
(   - Wireless Mesh \(e.g. WirelessHART, Zigbee\): Self-healing, multi-hop mesh topologies where) Tj
T*
(   every node routes packets for adjacent nodes, bypassing heavy metal factory obstacles with) Tj
T*
(   99.999% reliability.) Tj
T*
(   - LPWAN \(LoRaWAN, NB-IoT\): Long-range wireless telemetry transmitting data packets over 10 to) Tj
T*
(   15 kilometers with ultra-low power consumption, enabling battery-operated sensor nodes to) Tj
