/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the career profile and technical domain of an Optical Network Engineer, analyzing fiber backbones, Dense Wavelength Division Multiplexing \(DWDM\), coherent optical transceivers, and submarine cable systems.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Global Optical Infrastructure:) Tj
T*
(   - Over 99% of global intercontinental internet data traffic travels not via satellites, but) Tj
T*
(   through undersea optical fiber submarine cables spanning hundreds of thousands of kilometers) Tj
T*
(   across ocean floors. Terrestrial optical backbones interconnect metropolitan data centers and) Tj
T*
(   5G cellular base stations.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Core DWDM Architecture:) Tj
T*
(   - Optical Channel Grid: Dense Wavelength Division Multiplexing \(DWDM\) multiplexes dozens of) Tj
T*
(   distinct high-speed optical wavelengths \(typically 40 to 96 channels in the ITU-T C-band: 1530) Tj
T*
(   nm to 1565 nm\) onto a single hair-thin silica glass fiber.) Tj
T*
(   - Optical Amplification: Erbium-Doped Fiber Amplifiers \(EDFAs\) and Raman distributed amplifiers) Tj
T*
(   are deployed every 80 to 100 kilometers along the cable span, pumping 980 nm or 1480 nm laser) Tj
T*
(   light into the fiber core to optically re-energize attenuated signals without costly) Tj
T*
(   optical-to-electrical conversion.) Tj
T*
(   - Reconfigurable Optical Add-Drop Multiplexers \(ROADM\): Wavelength-selective switches \(WSS\)) Tj
T*
(   based on liquid crystal on silicon \(LCoS\) that route individual optical wavelengths dynamically) Tj
T*
(   across complex mesh networks without manual fiber patching.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Coherent Optical Transceivers \(400G / 800G / 1.6T\):) Tj
T*
(   - Modulation & Detection: Utilizing dual-polarization 16-QAM and 64-QAM modulation at symbol) Tj
T*
(   rates exceeding 100 GigaBaud.) Tj
T*
(   - Dedicated DSP Silicon: 5nm/3nm CMOS coherent DSP chips perform real-time digital) Tj
T*
(   equalizations: compensating for thousands of picoseconds per nanometer of chromatic dispersion,) Tj
T*
(   polarization mode dispersion, and non-linear Kerr fiber phase shifts, achieving) Tj
T*
(   terabit-per-second throughput across transoceanic distances.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
