(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Mission of EMC / RFI Engineering:) Tj
T*
(   - Every electronic device operating with high-frequency switching currents is an unintentional) Tj
T*
(   radiator of electromagnetic energy. Simultaneously, every device must operate reliably in) Tj
T*
(   environments crowded with external electromagnetic noise \(Wi-Fi, cellular, electrostatic) Tj
T*
(   discharges, lightning surges\).) Tj
T*
(   - EMC engineers ensure that electronic products satisfy strict legal regulatory standards \(e.g.) Tj
T*
(   FCC Part 15 in the USA, CE mark in the European Union, CISPR standards globally\) before) Tj
T*
(   commercial sale.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. The Two Branches of EMC:) Tj
T*
(   - Radiated & Conducted Emissions: Measuring electromagnetic fields radiated through the air) Tj
T*
(   \(Radiated Emissions\) and high-frequency noise currents conducted back into AC mains power cords) Tj
T*
(   \(Conducted Emissions\). Excessive emissions can disrupt aircraft communications, emergency) Tj
T*
(   radios, and neighboring consumer electronics.) Tj
T*
(   - Radiated & Conducted Immunity \(Susceptibility\): Proving that the product survives external) Tj
T*
(   high-voltage electrostatic discharge \(ESD - up to 8 kV contact / 15 kV air discharge\),) Tj
T*
(   electrical fast transient \(EFT\) bursts, and high-intensity RF electromagnetic fields without) Tj
T*
(   rebooting, memory corruption, or hardware destruction.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Laboratory Testing & Engineering Mitigation:) Tj
T*
(   - Semi-Anechoic Test Chambers: Testing is conducted inside massive shielded copper/steel rooms) Tj
T*
(   lined with carbon-loaded ferrite tiles and pyramidal foam absorbers to eliminate environmental) Tj
T*
(   RF reflections and external radio stations.) Tj
T*
(   - Hardware Mitigation Techniques: Integrating common-mode chokes on power lines, shielding) Tj
T*
(   sensitive circuits inside stamped metal cans \(RF shields\), eliminating ground loops, placing) Tj
T*
(   transient voltage suppressor \(TVS\) diodes on external I/O pins, and designing unbroken) Tj
T*
(   continuous ground return planes on PCBs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
