T*
(   - Highly Accelerated Life Testing \(HALT\) & HAST: Testing electronic assemblies under rapid) Tj
T*
(   thermal cycling \(-50 deg C to +150 deg C\), multi-axis mechanical vibration, and high-pressure) Tj
T*
(   steam humidity.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Silicon Failure Analysis \(FA\) Methodologies:) Tj
T*
(   - When an IC fails during qualification or in the field, FA engineers conduct forensic physical) Tj
T*
(   analysis to identify root cause down to the atomic level.) Tj
T*
(   - Techniques: Non-destructive acoustic microscopy and X-ray inspection to detect packaging) Tj
T*
(   delamination; chemical and plasma decapping to expose the bare silicon die; Emission Microscopy) Tj
T*
(   \(EMMI\) to detect hot-carrier photon emissions at short-circuit locations; Focused Ion Beam) Tj
T*
(   \(FIB\) to mill nanoscale cross-sections; and Scanning Electron Microscopy \(SEM\) / Transmission) Tj
T*
(   Electron Microscopy \(TEM\) to image atomic lattice dislocations.) Tj
T*
